<Positioned left="252" top="1460"><Text fontSize="20" color="#1E2A22FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">怎么报名</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1496" width="920" height="22"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">社区服务站登记，或扫描下方图形码填写表单</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1526" width="920" height="22"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">报名时请说明孩子年龄；名额按登记顺序先到先得。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1556" width="920" height="22"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="15" color="#8A8577FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">活动由志愿者带领，不收取费用；材料来自种子基金。</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1590"><Container width="920" height="1" color="#E3DED0FF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="252" top="1598" width="920" height="20"><Container alignment="CENTER_LEFT"><Text fontSize="14" color="#2C3B31FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">咨询：云栖里社区服务站（虚构）· 每周二、四 14:00–18:00</Text></Container></Positioned>
